    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sceneName
      value: GameDev
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: musicCutter
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playerReact
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSpeed
      value: 0.02
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sceneTransition
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 11
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey there. How are you doing?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: Me? Well I'm the game developer. A pleasure to meet you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: So, you thought you could beat the game without interacting with anything,
        huh?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: That's really unfortunate. I mean, I spent a lot of time coding and
        making the art.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: And for you to just ignore it all and try to speedrun the game is just...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: No, I'm not mad. Just... disappointed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: I spent a ton of time making some...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[7]'
      value: STRANGE PLACES
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[8]'
      value: ...for you to explore, but I guess you want something else.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[9]'
      value: Tell you what, I'll give you a special ending. How about that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5779099381838723715, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[10]'
      value: You must accept, I never coded yes or no options.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8506313314646402879, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: DialogueTrigger
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: d4b7bceea2416ae48b3f670d2b767567, type: 3}
